==Trivia==
This card's immersive illustration includes {{p|Venusaur}}, {{p|Blastoise}}, {{p|Pidgeot}}, {{p|Fearow}}, {{p|Pikachu}}, {{p|Sandshrew}}, {{p|Jigglypuff}}, {{p|Psyduck}}, {{p|Poliwrath}}, {{p|Goldeen}}, {{p|Mr. Mime}}, {{p|Tauros}}, {{p|Gyarados}}, and {{p|Dragonite}}.

===Origin===
*{{m|Slash}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Charizard}} can learn.
*'''Crimson Storm''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Charizard-GX|20}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.

